@startuml article-lifecycle
title Presserl – Article Lifecycle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Sans-Serif
hide empty description

[*] --> Draft : new article

Draft --> Published : publish\n[author may publish in section]
Draft --> Submitted : publish\n[author may not publish]
Submitted --> Published : approve\n(section editor / publisher)
Submitted --> Draft : reject with note
Submitted --> Draft : withdraw (author)

Published --> Offline : take offline\n(author, section editor, publisher, operator)
Offline --> Published : back online\n[same rule as publish]
Offline --> Draft : revise
Offline --> [*] : delete

Published : Edits create a new revision;
Published : the live revision stays until the next publish.

note right of Draft
  Simplest case (publisher only):
  Draft → Published → Offline
  One click, no review.
end note
@enduml
